    {
      "name": "RegisterFormat",
      "summary": "RegisterFormat registers an image format for use by [Decode]. Name is the name of the format, like \"jpeg\" or \"png\". Magic is the magic prefix that identifies the format's encoding. The magic string can contain \"?\" wildcards that each match any one byte. [Decode] is the function that decodes the encoded image. [DecodeConfig] is the function that decodes just its configuration.",
      "signature": "func RegisterFormat(name, magic string, decode func(io.Reader) (Image, error), decodeConfig func(io.Reader) (Config, error))",
